+# Native add-ons
+
+Packages with native code usually rebuild on install. A typical manifest looks like:
+
+```json
+{
+  "scripts": {
+    "postinstall": "node-gyp rebuild"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+We do not ship native add-ons today, so our own package.json has no install hooks.
